ezQY5pQT1hHMRAUqB7Pco2y1KKcarKgUrtb63tZq6JgCI6OTG7H8CgXAk4FRrAHZDr\/yuJhAOBBy79QTgToEN+uT0y05uRFxHT46HZ7MCMMwOaUyeWcHyap8LFjWX5Vu8g+LuynaW0G+x36N9Xrg5vQssIWPxjk2gMpkmG41nzICUjHeYXMYpxssZcTwY4aqI54CpWyLnCkqLLbbYYl\/Dbg0\/reus8k51BNXcri1fgGuxxRb7UlaJojfAKpbnl9BsscUWW+xr2Bx3ruFQv+xFoApv6y02f98CgIsttljgwmvA9NrrzD7Cvd9oH\/L1H\/icEPHWDhdbbLHfv10DqLd4UfN1NfS7BVTXHl8Co1ue1wJUiy222FtwoAen+AubABXQBnzG8\/7xmi3J9cUWW2xur+WcXnp9FahSSpCuH+4aUM3tWoh4bf1iiy222OcA1K3lmZkRXtX871ZINxlScMNeCxcXW2yx36+9dP+\/tOzaIxHhfwErBUobgFd8SQAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==","imageWidth":298,"imageHeight":130,"imageLeft":2645,"imageTop":1251,"screenWidth":3168,"screenHeight":1440,"screenDpi":4}}},{"name":"wait_after_save","value":{"varType":"number","varScope":"script","showInput":true,"showInputLabel":"保存等待时间（ms）","mustInput":false,"rememberInputValue":true,"textLineBefore":"默认1000","showInputContentAlign":"left","syncValueOnChange":true}},{"name":"progress_area","value":{"varType":"screen_area","varScope":"script","showInput":true,"showInputLabel":"已使用画布次数位置","mustInput":true,"rememberInputValue":true,"showInputContentAlign":"left","syncValueOnChange":true}},{"name":"color_tolerance","value":{"varType":"string","varScope":"script","showInput":true,"showInputLabel":"颜色匹配容差","mustInput":false,"rememberInputValue":true,"textLineBefore":"默认40","showInputContentAlign":"left","syncValueOnChange":true,"value":""}},{"name":"log_level","value":{"varType":"number","varScope":"script","showInput":true,"showInputLabel":"日志开关","mustInput":true,"rememberInputValue":true,"showInputWidthBasis":"auto","showInputContentAlign":"left","syncValueOnChange":true,"selectItems":[0,1,2]}}],"dialogShowOnce":true,"dialogCancelText":"停止","dialogCancelAction":{"type":"控制执行","delayUnit":1,"controlRunType":"stop","jumpToPosition":"","ContinueParentExecute":false}}
{"type":"运行JS代码","delay":"0","delayUnit":1,"jsCode":"\/**\n * 自动精灵：画板脚本（全流程 2 级日志 & 菜单重构版）\n *\/\n(function main() {\n    \/\/ ================= 1. 日志模块 =================\n    const Logger = {\n        level: (() => {\n            const val = zdjl.getVar(\"log_level\");\n            if (val === null || val === undefined || val === '') return 2;\n            const parsed = parseInt(val, 10);\n            return isNaN(parsed) ? 2 : Math.max(0, parsed);\n        })(),\n\n        init() {\n            if (this.level >= 1) {\n                try { console.show(); } catch (e) {}\n            } else {\n                try { console.hide(); } catch (e) {}\n            }\n            this.info(\"日志系统初始化完成，当前 Log Level:\", this.level);\n        },\n\n        info(...args) {\n            if (this.level >= 1) console.log(`[INFO] [${this.getTime()}]`, ...args);\n        },\n\n        debug(...args) {\n            if (this.level >= 2) console.log(`[DEBUG] [${this.getTime()}]`, ...args);\n        },\n\n        warn(...args) {\n            if (this.level >= 1) console.warn(`[WARN] [${this.getTime()}]`, ...args);\n        },\n\n        error(...args) {\n            console.error(`[ERROR] [${this.getTime()}]`, ...args);\n        },\n\n        getTime() {\n            const d = new Date();\n            return `${d.getHours().toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${d.getMinutes().toString().padStart(2, '0')}:${d.getSeconds().toString().padStart(2, '0')}.${d.getMilliseconds().toString().padStart(3, '0')}`;\n        }\n    };\n\n    Logger.init();\n\n    \/\/ ================= 2. 画板页面状态校验模块 =================\n    function isBoardPage(config) {\n        if (!config) {\n            Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 配置对象为空，默认判定为在画板\");\n            return true;\n        }\n        try {\n            if (config.saveBtnImg && config.saveBtnImg.data) {\n                Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 正在匹配保存按钮图...\");\n                const loc = zdjl.findLocation({ type: 'image', imageData: config.saveBtnImg });\n                if (loc) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[页面校验] 匹配保存按钮图成功，坐标: (${loc.x}, ${loc.y})`);\n                    return true;\n                }\n                Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 未匹配到保存按钮图\");\n            }\n            if (config.addBtnImg && config.addBtnImg.data) {\n                Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 正在匹配添加按钮图...\");\n                const loc = zdjl.findLocation({ type: 'image', imageData: config.addBtnImg });\n                if (loc) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[页面校验] 匹配添加按钮图成功，坐标: (${loc.x}, ${loc.y})`);\n                    return true;\n                }\n                Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 未匹配到添加按钮图\");\n            }\n            Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 正在进行 UI 节点包名匹配...\");\n            const node = zdjl.findNode({ type: 'node' });\n            if (node) {\n                const rawPkg = String(node.packageName || node.pkg || node.package || \"\").trim();\n                Logger.debug(`[页面校验] 获取节点包名: \"${rawPkg}\"`);\n                if (rawPkg && config.targetPackages && config.targetPackages.some(pkg => String(pkg).trim() === rawPkg)) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[页面校验] 包名 \"${rawPkg}\" 与目标应用一致`);\n                    return true;\n                }\n            } else {\n                Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 未能获取到有效的 UI 节点信息\");\n            }\n        } catch (e) {\n            Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 匹配过程捕获异常:\", e.message);\n        }\n        Logger.debug(\"[页面校验] 判定当前不在画板界面\");\n        return false;\n    }\n\n    function ensureBoardPage(config) {\n        Logger.debug(\"[页面状态] 开始执行 ensureBoardPage 校验\");\n        if (!isBoardPage(config)) {\n            UI.showToast(\"尝试进入画板...\");\n            Logger.debug(\"[页面状态] 尝试点击添加按钮跳转进入画板\");\n            if (PainterEngine.safeFindAndClick(config.addBtnImg, \"添加\", config.boardClickDuration)) {\n                Logger.debug(`[页面状态] 已点击添加按钮，等待 ${config.delayNew}ms`);\n                zdjl.sleep(config.delayNew);\n            }\n            const ready = isBoardPage(config);\n            if (!ready) {\n                UI.showToast(\"页面校验失败：未找到画板界面\");\n                Logger.error(\"[页面状态] 未能进入或匹配到画板页面\");\n            } else {\n                Logger.debug(\"[页面状态] 确认进入画板界面\");\n            }\n            return ready;\n        }\n        Logger.debug(\"[页面状态] 校验通过，当前处于画板界面\");\n        return true;\n    }\n\n    \/\/ ================= 3. UI 交互与文件选择模块 =================\n    const UI = {\n        toastTemplate: {\n            type: \"系统提示\", delayUnit: 1, promptType: \"toast\",\n            promptText: \"\", promptTitle: \"\", showPosition: \"top\",\n            playAudio: \"false\", useVibrator: false\n        },\n\n        showToast(text) {\n            Logger.info(\"Toast:\", text);\n            const action = Object.assign({}, this.toastTemplate, { promptText: text });\n            try { zdjl.runAction(action); } catch (e) { try { zdjl.toast(text); } catch (e2) {} }\n        },\n\n        select(title, items) {\n            if (!items || items.length === 0) return -1;\n            if (typeof zdjl.select !== \"function\") return -1;\n            Logger.debug(`[UI Select] 弹出窗口: \"${title}\"，列表数量: ${items.length}`);\n            const res = zdjl.select({ title, items });\n            const selectedIdx = (res && res.result !== undefined) ? res.result : -1;\n            Logger.debug(`[UI Select] 用户选择索引结果: ${selectedIdx}`);\n            return selectedIdx;\n        }\n    };\n\n    function showModeSelection() {\n        Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 打开主菜单\");\n        return UI.select(\"请选择运行模式\", [\n            \"1. 正常作画 (选择数据输入方式)\",\n            \"2. 循环测试 (色号循环填充测试)\",\n            \"3. Debug 提取 (采集 HEX 写入剪贴板)\",\n            \"4. 访问配套数据网站 (结束并跳转)\"\n        ]);\n    }\n\n    function showInputMenu() {\n        Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 打开数据输入菜单\");\n        return UI.select(\"选择数据输入方式\", [\n            \"1. 粘贴 JSON 或 色号文本\",\n            \"2. 可视化选择文件\"\n        ]);\n    }\n\n    function showTestMenu() {\n        Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 打开测试子菜单\");\n        return UI.select(\"测试菜单\", [\n            \"1. 4角点+中心点测试\",\n            \"2. 顺序填充作画测试\",\n            \"3. 色号循环填充测试\"\n        ]);\n    }\n\n    function promptDataInput(hintStr, defaultVal = \"\") {\n        Logger.debug(`[UI Prompt] 弹出文本输入窗口: \"${hintStr}\"`);\n        let inputResult = null;\n        try {\n            if (typeof zdjl.prompt === \"function\") {\n                inputResult = zdjl.prompt(hintStr, defaultVal);\n            } else if (typeof prompt === \"function\") {\n                inputResult = prompt(hintStr, defaultVal);\n            }\n        } catch (e) {\n            Logger.error(\"[UI Prompt] 文本输入捕获异常:\", e);\n        }\n        Logger.debug(`[UI Prompt] 获取输入文本长度: ${inputResult ? inputResult.length : 0}`);\n        return inputResult;\n    }\n\n    function pickLocalFile(startDir) {\n        Logger.debug(\"[文件选择] 启动本地文件检索\");\n        let fs;\n        try {\n            fs = require('fs');\n        } catch (e) {\n            Logger.error(\"[文件选择] 沙盒 FS 模块 require 失败:\", e);\n            UI.showToast(\"环境不支持沙盒 FS 读取\");\n            return null;\n        }\n\n        const storedExts = zdjl.getVar(\"file_filter_exts\");\n        let activeExts = storedExts ? String(storedExts).split(',').map(s => s.trim().toLowerCase()).filter(Boolean) : ['.json', '.js', '.txt'];\n        Logger.debug(\"[文件选择] 当前过滤扩展名规则:\", activeExts.join(', '));\n\n        let currentDir = startDir || \"\/sdcard\/Download\";\n        if (!fs.existsSync(currentDir)) {\n            Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 默认路径 ${currentDir} 不存在，重置至 \/sdcard`);\n            currentDir = \"\/sdcard\";\n        }\n\n        while (true) {\n            Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 扫描目录路径: ${currentDir}`);\n            let entries = [];\n            try {\n                entries = fs.readdirSync(currentDir);\n                Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 目录下原始条目数: ${entries.length}`);\n            } catch (e) {\n                Logger.error(`[文件选择] 无法读取目录 ${currentDir}:`, e.message);\n                UI.showToast(\"无法读取目录，已重置至根目录\");\n                currentDir = \"\/sdcard\";\n                continue;\n            }\n\n            const dirs = [];\n            const files = [];\n\n            entries.forEach(name => {\n                if (name.startsWith('.')) return;\n                const fullPath = (currentDir.endsWith('\/') ? currentDir : currentDir + '\/') + name;\n                try {\n                    const stat = fs.statSync(fullPath);\n                    if (stat.isDirectory()) {\n                        dirs.push(name);\n                    } else {\n                        const lowerName = name.toLowerCase();\n                        const isMatch = activeExts.includes('*') || activeExts.some(ext => lowerName.endsWith(ext));\n                        if (isMatch) {\n                            files.push(name);\n                        } else {\n                            Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 过滤非目标文件: ${name}`);\n                        }\n                    }\n                } catch (e) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 获取文件 state 异常: ${fullPath}`);\n                }\n            });\n\n            dirs.sort();\n            files.sort();\n            Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 过滤完成: 文件夹 ${dirs.length} 个, 文件 ${files.length} 个`);\n\n            const items = [];\n            if (currentDir !== \"\/\" && currentDir !== \"\/sdcard\") {\n                items.push(\"返回上级目录 [..]\");\n            }\n            \n            const filterLabel = activeExts.includes('*') ? \"全部(*)\" : activeExts.join(',');\n            items.push(`⚙️ 设置文件过滤类型 (当前: ${filterLabel})`);\n\n            dirs.forEach(d => items.push(\"[文件夹] \" + d));\n            files.forEach(f => items.push(\"[文件] \" + f));\n\n            const selectResIdx = UI.select(\"路径: \" + currentDir, items);\n\n            if (selectResIdx === -1) {\n                Logger.debug(\"[文件选择] 取消文件选择，返回上一级菜单\");\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            const chosenText = items[selectResIdx];\n            Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 用户选中: \"${chosenText}\"`);\n\n            if (chosenText === \"返回上级目录 [..]\") {\n                const parts = currentDir.replace(\/\\\/$\/, '').split('\/');\n                parts.pop();\n                currentDir = parts.join('\/') || '\/';\n                Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 返回至上级路径: ${currentDir}`);\n            } else if (chosenText.startsWith(\"⚙️ 设置文件过滤类型\")) {\n                const optIdx = UI.select(\"选择修改方式\", [\n                    \"1. 临时修改 (仅本次运行生效)\",\n                    \"2. 默认设置 (持久化保存配置)\"\n                ]);\n\n                if (optIdx !== -1) {\n                    const currentExtStr = activeExts.join(',');\n                    const inputStr = promptDataInput(\"输入文件扩展名 (用逗号分隔，输入 * 显示全部)\", currentExtStr);\n\n                    if (inputStr !== null && inputStr.trim() !== \"\") {\n                        const newExts = inputStr.split(',')\n                            .map(s => s.trim().toLowerCase())\n                            .map(s => (s.startsWith('.') || s === '*') ? s : '.' + s)\n                            .filter(Boolean);\n\n                        if (newExts.length > 0) {\n                            activeExts = newExts;\n                            Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 更新文件扩展名规则: ${activeExts.join(', ')}`);\n                            if (optIdx === 1) {\n                                zdjl.setVar(\"file_filter_exts\", activeExts.join(','));\n                                UI.showToast(\"已持久化更新文件过滤规则\");\n                            } else {\n                                UI.showToast(\"已临时修改文件过滤规则\");\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            } else if (chosenText.startsWith(\"[文件夹] \")) {\n                const dirName = chosenText.replace(\"[文件夹] \", \"\");\n                currentDir = (currentDir.endsWith('\/') ? currentDir : currentDir + '\/') + dirName;\n                Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 进入文件夹: ${currentDir}`);\n            } else if (chosenText.startsWith(\"[文件] \")) {\n                const fileName = chosenText.replace(\"[文件] \", \"\");\n                const filePath = (currentDir.endsWith('\/') ? currentDir : currentDir + '\/') + fileName;\n                Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 尝试读取文件: ${filePath}`);\n                try {\n                    const content = fs.readFileSync(filePath, 'utf-8');\n                    Logger.debug(`[文件选择] 文件读取完成，流字节数: ${content.length}`);\n                    return content;\n                } catch (e) {\n                    Logger.error(`[文件选择] 读取文件失败: ${e.message}`);\n                    UI.showToast(\"读取文件失败：\" + e.message);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    \/\/ ================= 4. 极速 Hash 模块 =================\n    const Crypto = {\n        fastHash(str) {\n            if (!str) return \"empty\";\n            let hash = 5381;\n            const len = str.length;\n            const step = len > 1000 ? Math.floor(len \/ 500) : 1;\n            for (let i = 0; i < len; i += step) {\n                hash = ((hash << 5) + hash) + str.charCodeAt(i);\n                hash |= 0;\n            }\n            const res = (hash >>> 0).toString(16) + \"_\" + len;\n            Logger.debug(`[Crypto] 计算 FastHash 结果: ${res} (源串长度: ${len})`);\n            return res;\n        }\n    };\n\n    \/\/ ================= 5. 配置解析模块 =================\n    const Config = {\n        parseArea(varName) {\n            const varData = zdjl.getVar(varName);\n            Logger.debug(`[配置解析] 读取坐标区域变量 \"${varName}\":`, JSON.stringify(varData));\n            if (!varData || typeof varData !== 'object') return null;\n            if ('left' in varData && 'top' in varData) {\n                return {\n                    left: Number(varData.left), top: Number(varData.top),\n                    right: Number(varData.right || varData.left),\n                    bottom: Number(varData.bottom || varData.top)\n                };\n            }\n            if ('x' in varData && 'y' in varData) {\n                const x = Number(varData.x), y = Number(varData.y);\n                return { left: x, top: y, right: x, bottom: y };\n            }\n            if (Array.isArray(varData) && varData.length === 2) {\n                const p1 = varData[0], p2 = varData[1];\n                if (Array.isArray(p1) && Array.isArray(p2) && p1.length === 2 && p2.length === 2) {\n                    return {\n                        left: Math.min(p1[0], p2[0]), top: Math.min(p1[1], p2[1]),\n                        right: Math.max(p1[0], p2[0]), bottom: Math.max(p1[1], p2[1])\n                    };\n                }\n            }\n            return null;\n        },\n\n        normalizeImageData(varName) {\n            const raw = zdjl.getVar(varName);\n            if (!raw) {\n                Logger.debug(`[配置解析] 图标数据 \"${varName}\" 未配置`);\n                return null;\n            }\n            Logger.debug(`[配置解析] 规范化图片定位对象 \"${varName}\"`);\n            if (raw.data && raw.data.length > 0) {\n                return {\n                    data: raw.data,\n                    imageWidth: raw.imageWidth || raw.width || 0,\n                    imageHeight: raw.imageHeight || raw.height || 0,\n                    imageLeft: raw.imageLeft || raw.left || 0,\n                    imageTop: raw.imageTop || raw.top || 0,\n                    screenWidth: raw.screenWidth || 0,\n                    screenHeight: raw.screenHeight || 0,\n                    screenDpi: raw.screenDpi || raw.scale || 1\n                };\n            }\n            if (raw.base64 && raw.base64.length > 0) {\n                return {\n                    data: raw.base64,\n                    imageWidth: raw.width || raw.imageWidth || 0,\n                    imageHeight: raw.height || raw.imageHeight || 0,\n                    imageLeft: raw.left || raw.imageLeft || 0,\n                    imageTop: raw.top || raw.top || 0,\n                    screenWidth: raw.screenWidth || 0,\n                    screenHeight: raw.screenHeight || 0,\n                    screenDpi: raw.scale || raw.screenDpi || 1\n                };\n            }\n            return null;\n        },\n\n        getInt(varName, defaultVal) {\n            const val = zdjl.getVar(varName);\n            if (val === null || val === undefined || val === '') {\n                Logger.debug(`[配置解析] 变量 \"${varName}\" 缺省，回退默认值: ${defaultVal}`);\n                return defaultVal;\n            }\n            const parsed = parseInt(val, 10);\n            const res = isNaN(parsed) ? defaultVal : parsed;\n            Logger.debug(`[配置解析] 变量 \"${varName}\" 参数值: ${res}`);\n            return res;\n        },\n\n        load() {\n            Logger.debug(\"[配置解析] 开始载入全局配置\");\n            const boardRect = this.parseArea(\"board_area\");\n            const paletteRect = this.parseArea(\"palette_area\");\n\n            if (!boardRect || !paletteRect) {\n                Logger.error(\"[配置解析] 画板或色板区域缺失\");\n                UI.showToast(\"配置错误：画板或色板区域未设置\");\n                return null;\n            }\n\n            const saveBtnImg = this.normalizeImageData(\"save_btn_image\");\n            const addBtnImg = this.normalizeImageData(\"add_btn_image\");\n\n            const defaultPkgs = [\"com.hypergryph.arknights\", \"com.hypergryph.arknights.bilibili\"];\n            const userPkg = zdjl.getVar(\"target_package\");\n            const rawList = userPkg ? [userPkg, ...defaultPkgs] : defaultPkgs;\n\n            const cfg = {\n                board: boardRect,\n                palette: paletteRect,\n                saveBtnImg: saveBtnImg,\n                addBtnImg: addBtnImg,\n                boardCols: this.getInt(\"board_cols\", 24),\n                boardRows: this.getInt(\"board_rows\", 24),\n                cols: this.getInt(\"palette_cols\", 4),\n                paletteTotalCount: this.getInt(\"palette_total_count\", 40),\n                visibleRows: this.getInt(\"palette_visible_rows\", 6),\n                delayBoard: this.getInt(\"board_click_delay\", 40),\n                delayPalette: this.getInt(\"palette_click_delay\", 40),\n                delayStart: this.getInt(\"start_delay\", 3000),\n                delaySave: this.getInt(\"wait_after_save\", 2000),\n                delayNew: this.getInt(\"wait_after_new\", 2000),\n                boardClickDuration: this.getInt(\"board_click_duration\", 20),\n                targetPackages: Array.from(new Set(rawList.filter(Boolean)))\n            };\n\n            cfg.totalRows = Math.ceil(cfg.paletteTotalCount \/ cfg.cols);\n            cfg.needsPagination = cfg.totalRows > cfg.visibleRows;\n            cfg.bottomViewportStartRow = cfg.needsPagination ? (cfg.totalRows - cfg.visibleRows) : 0;\n            cfg.cellW = (cfg.palette.right - cfg.palette.left) \/ cfg.cols;\n            cfg.cellH = (cfg.palette.bottom - cfg.palette.top) \/ cfg.visibleRows;\n            cfg.midX = Math.floor(cfg.palette.left + (cfg.palette.right - cfg.palette.left) \/ 2);\n\n            Logger.debug(\"[配置解析] 配置全量解析完毕:\", JSON.stringify({\n                board: cfg.board, palette: cfg.palette,\n                boardCols: cfg.boardCols, boardRows: cfg.boardRows,\n                cols: cfg.cols, paletteTotalCount: cfg.paletteTotalCount,\n                needsPagination: cfg.needsPagination, totalRows: cfg.totalRows\n            }));\n            return cfg;\n        }\n    };\n\n    \/\/ ================= 6. 数据解析与严格校验模块 =================\n    const DataParser = {\n        validate(dataContent) {\n            Logger.debug(\"[数据校验] 校验原始输入数据，类型:\", typeof dataContent);\n            if (typeof dataContent !== 'string') {\n                return { valid: false, message: \"输入类型无效，必须为文本\" };\n            }\n            const trimmed = dataContent.trim();\n            Logger.debug(`[数据校验] 输入文本字符数: ${trimmed.length}`);\n            if (trimmed.length === 0) {\n                return { valid: false, message: \"数据内容为空\" };\n            }\n\n            if (trimmed.startsWith('{') || trimmed.startsWith('[')) {\n                Logger.debug(\"[数据校验] 检测到 JSON 前缀，尝试 JSON 校验\");\n                try {\n                    const json = JSON.parse(trimmed);\n                    if (typeof json === 'object' && json !== null) {\n                        if (json.masterGrid || json.format === \"arknights_draw-mosaic-project\") {\n                            Logger.debug(\"[数据校验] 校验成功: Mosaic 多区块方案结构\");\n                            if (!json.masterGrid && !json.grid) {\n                                return { valid: false, message: \"Mosaic JSON 缺少 masterGrid 或 grid 字段\" };\n                            }\n                            return { valid: true, message: \"Mosaic JSON 格式正确\" };\n                        }\n                        if (Array.isArray(json.grid) || json.cells || Array.isArray(json)) {\n                            Logger.debug(\"[数据校验] 校验成功: 标准单区块 JSON 结构\");\n                            return { valid: true, message: \"标准 JSON 数据格式正确\" };\n                        }\n                    }\n                } catch (e) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[数据校验] JSON 语法坏损: ${e.message}`);\n                    return { valid: false, message: \"JSON 格式语法损坏: \" + e.message };\n                }\n            }\n\n            Logger.debug(\"[数据校验] 进行 Token 分词规则校验\");\n            const tokens = trimmed.split(\/[\\s\\n\\r,;|]+\/).filter(Boolean);\n            Logger.debug(`[数据校验] 提取 Token 节点数: ${tokens.length}`);\n            if (tokens.length === 0) {\n                return { valid: false, message: \"未提取到有效的数值或色号 Token\" };\n            }\n\n            const hasValidToken = tokens.some(t => \/^#([0-9a-fA-F]{6}|[0-9a-fA-F]{3})$\/.test(t) || \/^\\d+$\/.test(t));\n            if (!hasValidToken) {\n                return { valid: false, message: \"未匹配到合法的 HEX 色号或矩阵数字 Token\" };\n            }\n\n            Logger.debug(\"[数据校验] 校验成功: 纯文本 Token 规则符合\");\n            return { valid: true, message: \"文本 Token 数据合规\" };\n        },\n\n        parse(dataContent, config) {\n            Logger.debug(\"[数据解析] 开始进行矩阵映射转换\");\n            const check = this.validate(dataContent);\n            if (!check.valid) {\n                Logger.error(\"[数据解析] 前置校验拒绝:\", check.message);\n                throw new Error(check.message);\n            }\n\n            const trimmed = dataContent.trim();\n            let jsonData = null;\n            try { jsonData = JSON.parse(trimmed); } catch (e) {}\n\n            if (jsonData) {\n                if (jsonData.masterGrid || jsonData.format === \"arknights_draw-mosaic-project\") {\n                    const tileSize = jsonData.tileSize || config.boardCols;\n                    const tw = jsonData.tilesWide || 1;\n                    const th = jsonData.tilesHigh || 1;\n                    const mw = jsonData.masterWidth || (tw * tileSize);\n                    const mg = jsonData.masterGrid || jsonData.grid;\n\n                    Logger.debug(`[数据解析] Mosaic 项目模式 - tileSize: ${tileSize}, tw: ${tw}, th: ${th}, mw: ${mw}`);\n                    if (!mg) throw new Error(\"Mosaic 数据缺失 masterGrid\");\n\n                    config.boardCols = tileSize;\n                    config.boardRows = tileSize;\n                    const totalTiles = tw * th;\n                    const mats = [];\n\n                    for (let ti = totalTiles - 1; ti >= 0; ti--) {\n                        const tr = Math.floor(ti \/ tw);\n                        const tc = ti % tw;\n                        const matrix = Array.from({ length: tileSize }, () => Array(tileSize).fill(-1));\n                        let validCount = 0;\n\n                        for (let r = 0; r < tileSize; r++) {\n                            for (let c = 0; c < tileSize; c++) {\n                                const globalR = tr * tileSize + r;\n                                const globalC = tc * tileSize + c;\n                                const v = parseInt(mg[globalR * mw + globalC], 10);\n                                if (!isNaN(v) && v >= 1 && v <= config.paletteTotalCount) {\n                                    matrix[r][c] = v - 1;\n                                    validCount++;\n                                } else {\n                                    matrix[r][c] = -1;\n                                }\n                            }\n                        }\n                        Logger.debug(`[数据解析] 转换区块 ${ti + 1}\/${totalTiles}，渲染有效像素: ${validCount} 点`);\n                        mats.push(matrix);\n                    }\n                    return mats;\n                }\n\n                if (jsonData.grid && Array.isArray(jsonData.grid)) {\n                    const gridSize = jsonData.gridSize || jsonData.size || config.boardCols;\n                    config.boardCols = gridSize;\n                    config.boardRows = gridSize;\n                    Logger.debug(`[数据解析] 单阵列 JSON 模式 - gridSize: ${gridSize}`);\n                    const matrix = Array.from({ length: config.boardRows }, () => Array(config.boardCols).fill(-1));\n                    let validCount = 0;\n\n                    for (let r = 0; r < config.boardRows; r++) {\n                        for (let c = 0; c < config.boardCols; c++) {\n                            const v = parseInt(jsonData.grid[r * config.boardCols + c], 10);\n                            if (!isNaN(v) && v >= 1 && v <= config.paletteTotalCount) {\n                                matrix[r][c] = v - 1;\n                                validCount++;\n                            }\n                        }\n                    }\n                    Logger.debug(`[数据解析] 生成单阵列矩阵，有效像素: ${validCount}`);\n                    return [matrix];\n                }\n\n                let cells = jsonData.cells || (Array.isArray(jsonData) ? jsonData : null);\n                if (cells && cells.length > 0) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[数据解析] 单元格列表模式 - 点位数量: ${cells.length}`);\n                    const matrix = Array.from({ length: config.boardRows }, () => Array(config.boardCols).fill(-1));\n                    let validCount = 0;\n                    cells.forEach(cell => {\n                        if (cell.x >= 0 && cell.x < config.boardCols && cell.y >= 0 && cell.y < config.boardRows) {\n                            let pIndex = -1;\n                            if (cell.palPos) {\n                                const m = cell.palPos.match(\/第(\\d+)行第(\\d+)列\/);\n                                if (m) pIndex = (parseInt(m[1]) - 1) * config.cols + (parseInt(m[2]) - 1);\n                            } else if (typeof cell.seq === 'number') {\n                                pIndex = (cell.seq - 1) % config.paletteTotalCount;\n                            }\n                            if (pIndex >= 0 && pIndex < config.paletteTotalCount) {\n                                matrix[cell.y][cell.x] = pIndex;\n                                validCount++;\n                            }\n                        }\n                    });\n                    Logger.debug(`[数据解析] 列表坐标转换完成，有效像素: ${validCount}`);\n                    return [matrix];\n                }\n            }\n\n            const requiredCount = config.boardCols * config.boardRows;\n            let tokens = trimmed.split(\/[\\s\\n\\r,;|]+\/).filter(Boolean);\n            Logger.debug(`[数据解析] 纯文本 Token 模式 - 要求点数: ${requiredCount}, 实际 Token: ${tokens.length}`);\n            if (tokens.length !== requiredCount) {\n                Logger.warn(`Token 数量 (${tokens.length}) 与画布容量 (${requiredCount}) 不一致，执行对齐截断\/补全`);\n                while (tokens.length < requiredCount) tokens.push(\"0\");\n                if (tokens.length > requiredCount) tokens = tokens.slice(0, requiredCount);\n            }\n\n            const matrix = Array.from({ length: config.boardRows }, () => Array(config.boardCols).fill(-1));\n            let idx = 0;\n            let validPoints = 0;\n\n            for (let r = 0; r < config.boardRows; r++) {\n                for (let c = 0; c < config.boardCols; c++) {\n                    const t = tokens[idx++];\n                    let v = parseInt(t, 10);\n                    if (t && (t.startsWith('#') || \/^[0-9A-Fa-f]{6}$\/.test(t))) v = 1;\n                    if (!isNaN(v) && v >= 1 && v <= config.paletteTotalCount) {\n                        matrix[r][c] = v - 1;\n                        validPoints++;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            Logger.debug(`[数据解析] 纯文本矩阵完成，有效点数: ${validPoints}`);\n            if (validPoints === 0) {\n                throw new Error(\"解析后未生成任何有效的像素矩阵点阵\");\n            }\n\n            return [matrix];\n        }\n    };\n\n    \/\/ ================= 7. 进度管理与色板控制 =================\n    const ProgressManager = {\n        loadProgress(inputContent) {\n            const hash = Crypto.fastHash(inputContent);\n            const key = 'draw_progress_' + hash;\n            Logger.debug(`[进度管理] 检索存储键: \"${key}\"`);\n            const saved = zdjl.getStorage(key);\n            if (saved) {\n                try {\n                    const p = JSON.parse(saved);\n                    if (p && p.hash === hash && Array.isArray(p.completedTiles)) {\n                        Logger.debug(`[进度管理] 读取断点数据，已被完成区块: [${p.completedTiles.join(', ')}]`);\n                        return { key, hash, completed: p.completedTiles };\n                    }\n                } catch (e) {\n                    Logger.error(\"[进度管理] 结构反序列化失败:\", e.message);\n                }\n            }\n            Logger.debug(\"[进度管理] 未找到匹配历史进度，启动全新流程\");\n            return { key, hash, completed: [] };\n        },\n\n        saveProgress(key, hash, completedArr) {\n            Logger.debug(`[进度管理] 写入进度存储 \"${key}\", 已完成索引: [${completedArr.join(', ')}]`);\n            try {\n                zdjl.setStorage(key, JSON.stringify({ hash, completedTiles: completedArr }));\n            } catch (e) {\n                Logger.error(\"[进度管理] 写入存储过程异常:\", e.message);\n            }\n        }\n    };\n\n    const PaletteController = {\n        currentViewState: -1,\n\n        ensureViewState(config, state) {\n            if (!config.needsPagination) {\n                this.currentViewState = 0;\n                return;\n            }\n            if (this.currentViewState === state) return;\n\n            Logger.debug(`[色板控制] 执行页面视图切换: ${this.currentViewState} -> ${state}`);\n            if (state === 0) {\n                Logger.debug(`[色板控制] 滑动切至顶栏: (${config.midX}, ${config.palette.top + 20}) -> (${config.midX}, ${config.palette.bottom - 20})`);\n                zdjl.swipe(config.midX, config.palette.top + 20, config.midX, config.palette.bottom - 20, 400);\n                zdjl.sleep(600);\n                this.currentViewState = 0;\n            } else {\n                Logger.debug(`[色板控制] 滑动切至底栏: (${config.midX}, ${config.palette.bottom - 20}) -> (${config.midX}, ${config.palette.top + 20})`);\n                zdjl.swipe(config.midX, config.palette.bottom - 20, config.midX, config.palette.top + 20, 400);\n                zdjl.sleep(600);\n                this.currentViewState = 1;\n            }\n        },\n\n        selectColor(config, targetIndex) {\n            const targetRow = Math.floor(targetIndex \/ config.cols);\n            const targetCol = targetIndex % config.cols;\n            let requiredState = 0;\n\n            if (config.needsPagination) {\n                if (targetRow >= config.visibleRows) requiredState = 1;\n                else if (targetRow < config.bottomViewportStartRow) requiredState = 0;\n            }\n\n            this.ensureViewState(config, requiredState);\n\n            const rowInViewport = (this.currentViewState === 0) ? targetRow : (targetRow - config.bottomViewportStartRow);\n            const cx = Math.floor(config.palette.left + targetCol * config.cellW + config.cellW \/ 2);\n            const cy = Math.floor(config.palette.top + rowInViewport * config.cellH + config.cellH \/ 2);\n\n            Logger.debug(`[色板控制] 选色 #${targetIndex + 1} (行:${targetRow}, 列:${targetCol}) -> 点击坐标 (${cx}, ${cy})`);\n            zdjl.click(cx, cy, 20);\n            zdjl.sleep(config.delayPalette);\n        },\n\n        extractColors(config) {\n            UI.showToast(\"开始提取色板颜色...\");\n            Logger.debug(\"[Debug提取] 启动 HEX 颜色抓取流程\");\n            zdjl.sleep(800);\n            const list = [];\n\n            this.ensureViewState(config, 0);\n            for (let i = 0; i < Math.min(config.paletteTotalCount, config.visibleRows * config.cols); i++) {\n                const r = Math.floor(i \/ config.cols), c = i % config.cols;\n                const cx = Math.floor(config.palette.left + c * config.cellW + config.cellW \/ 2);\n                const cy = Math.floor(config.palette.top + r * config.cellH + config.cellH \/ 2);\n                const col = zdjl.getScreenColor(cx, cy);\n                const hexStr = '#' + ((col || 0) & 0xFFFFFF).toString(16).padStart(6, '0').toUpperCase();\n                Logger.debug(`[Debug提取] 顶栏点位 #${i + 1} (${cx}, ${cy}) Color: ${col} -> ${hexStr}`);\n                list.push({ index: i + 1, hex: hexStr });\n            }\n\n            if (config.needsPagination) {\n                this.ensureViewState(config, 1);\n                for (let i = config.visibleRows * config.cols; i < config.paletteTotalCount; i++) {\n                    const r = Math.floor(i \/ config.cols), c = i % config.cols;\n                    const rowInView = r - config.bottomViewportStartRow;\n                    const cx = Math.floor(config.palette.left + c * config.cellW + config.cellW \/ 2);\n                    const cy = Math.floor(config.palette.top + rowInView * config.cellH + config.cellH \/ 2);\n                    const col = zdjl.getScreenColor(cx, cy);\n                    const hexStr = '#' + ((col || 0) & 0xFFFFFF).toString(16).padStart(6, '0').toUpperCase();\n                    Logger.debug(`[Debug提取] 底栏点位 #${i + 1} (${cx}, ${cy}) Color: ${col} -> ${hexStr}`);\n                    list.push({ index: i + 1, hex: hexStr });\n                }\n            }\n\n            const jsonStr = JSON.stringify(list, null, 2);\n            zdjl.setClipboard(jsonStr);\n            Logger.debug(\"[Debug提取] 色板 HEX 数据写入剪贴板完毕\");\n            UI.showToast(\"色板 HEX 数据已成功写入剪贴板\");\n        }\n    };\n\n    \/\/ ================= 8. 画板执行引擎 =================\n    const PainterEngine = {\n        safeFindAndClick(imageData, buttonName, duration) {\n            if (!imageData || !imageData.data) {\n                Logger.debug(`[引擎交互] 目标按钮 \"${buttonName}\" 图标数据空，跳过寻找`);\n                return false;\n            }\n            try {\n                Logger.debug(`[引擎交互] 正在定位按钮 \"${buttonName}\"...`);\n                const loc = zdjl.findLocation({ type: 'image', imageData: imageData });\n                if (loc) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[引擎交互] 找到按钮 \"${buttonName}\"，屏幕坐标 (${loc.x}, ${loc.y})，触发点击`);\n                    zdjl.click(loc.x, loc.y, duration);\n                    return true;\n                }\n                Logger.debug(`[引擎交互] 未找到按钮 \"${buttonName}\"`);\n                return false;\n            } catch (e) {\n                Logger.debug(`[引擎交互] 定位点击 \"${buttonName}\" 触发捕获异常:`, e.message);\n                return false;\n            }\n        },\n\n        getBoardXY(config, r, c) {\n            const bw = (config.board.right - config.board.left) \/ config.boardCols;\n            const bh = (config.board.bottom - config.board.top) \/ config.boardRows;\n            return {\n                x: Math.floor(config.board.left + c * bw + bw \/ 2),\n                y: Math.floor(config.board.top + r * bh + bh \/ 2)\n            };\n        },\n\n        generateLoopTestMatrix(config) {\n            UI.showToast(`执行：${config.paletteTotalCount} 色号循环填充测试`);\n            Logger.debug(`[测试引擎] 构造 ${config.paletteTotalCount} 色号循环测试点阵`);\n            const matrix = Array.from({ length: config.boardRows }, () => Array(config.boardCols).fill(0));\n            let idx = 0;\n            for (let r = 0; r < config.boardRows; r++) {\n                for (let c = 0; c < config.boardCols; c++) {\n                    matrix[r][c] = idx % config.paletteTotalCount;\n                    idx++;\n                }\n            }\n            return matrix;\n        },\n\n        drawCells(config, cells) {\n            const rowMap = {};\n            cells.forEach(c => {\n                if (!rowMap[c.r]) rowMap[c.r] = [];\n                rowMap[c.r].push(c.c);\n            });\n\n            const rows = Object.keys(rowMap).map(Number).sort((a, b) => a - b);\n            Logger.debug(`[渲染引擎] 批次渲染批处理，包含行数: ${rows.length}，待填像素数: ${cells.length}`);\n            for (const r of rows) {\n                const cols = rowMap[r].sort((a, b) => a - b);\n                for (const c of cols) {\n                    const { x, y } = this.getBoardXY(config, r, c);\n                    try {\n                        Logger.debug(`[画板点击] 格子 (${r}, ${c}) -> 坐标 (${x}, ${y})`);\n                        zdjl.click(x, y, config.boardClickDuration);\n                        zdjl.sleep(config.delayBoard);\n                    } catch (e) {\n                        Logger.error(`[画板点击] 坐标 (${x}, ${y}) 点击失败:`, e.message);\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        },\n\n        renderMatrix(config, matrix) {\n            Logger.debug(\"[渲染引擎] 开启全像素点阵渲染\");\n            PaletteController.ensureViewState(config, 0);\n\n            const freq = {};\n            for (let i = 0; i < config.paletteTotalCount; i++) freq[i] = [];\n\n            for (let r = 0; r < config.boardRows; r++) {\n                for (let c = 0; c < config.boardCols; c++) {\n                    const colorIdx = matrix[r][c];\n                    if (colorIdx >= 0 && colorIdx < config.paletteTotalCount) {\n                        freq[colorIdx].push({ r, c });\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            const page1 = [], page2 = [];\n            let sum1 = 0, sum2 = 0;\n\n            for (let i = 0; i < config.paletteTotalCount; i++) {\n                if (!freq[i].length) continue;\n                const row = Math.floor(i \/ config.cols);\n                if (!config.needsPagination || row < config.visibleRows) {\n                    page1.push({ idx: i, cells: freq[i] });\n                    sum1 += freq[i].length;\n                } else {\n                    page2.push({ idx: i, cells: freq[i] });\n                    sum2 += freq[i].length;\n                }\n            }\n\n            Logger.debug(`[渲染引擎] 色板密度算力结果: 顶栏 ${page1.length} 种颜色 (点数 ${sum1}), 底栏 ${page2.length} 种颜色 (点数 ${sum2})`);\n\n            page1.sort((a, b) => b.cells.length - a.cells.length);\n            page2.sort((a, b) => b.cells.length - a.cells.length);\n\n            let firstGroup = page1, secondGroup = page2;\n            if (config.needsPagination && sum2 > sum1) {\n                Logger.debug(\"[渲染引擎] 判定底栏像素点数高于顶栏，优先翻页绘制底栏\");\n                firstGroup = page2; secondGroup = page1;\n            }\n\n            for (const item of firstGroup) {\n                Logger.debug(`[渲染引擎] 第一组渲染 - 色号 #${item.idx + 1}，像素数: ${item.cells.length}`);\n                PaletteController.selectColor(config, item.idx);\n                this.drawCells(config, item.cells);\n            }\n\n            if (secondGroup.length) {\n                if (config.needsPagination) {\n                    const targetRow = Math.floor(secondGroup[0].idx \/ config.cols);\n                    if (targetRow >= config.visibleRows) PaletteController.ensureViewState(config, 1);\n                }\n                for (const item of secondGroup) {\n                    Logger.debug(`[渲染引擎] 第二组渲染 - 色号 #${item.idx + 1}，像素数: ${item.cells.length}`);\n                    PaletteController.selectColor(config, item.idx);\n                    this.drawCells(config, item.cells);\n                }\n            }\n            Logger.debug(\"[渲染引擎] 矩阵作画完毕\");\n        },\n\n        testCornersAndCenter(config) {\n            UI.showToast(\"测试：4角点+中心点\");\n            Logger.debug(\"[测试引擎] 执行 4 角点 + 中心点定位校验\");\n            const points = [\n                { name: \"左上角\", r: 0, c: 0 },\n                { name: \"右上角\", r: 0, c: config.boardCols - 1 },\n                { name: \"左下角\", r: config.boardRows - 1, c: 0 },\n                { name: \"右下角\", r: config.boardRows - 1, c: config.boardCols - 1 }\n            ];\n\n            const isEvenRows = config.boardRows % 2 === 0;\n            const isEvenCols = config.boardCols % 2 === 0;\n\n            if (isEvenRows && isEvenCols) {\n                const midR = config.boardRows \/ 2;\n                const midC = config.boardCols \/ 2;\n                points.push(\n                    { name: \"中心点(左上)\", r: midR - 1, c: midC - 1 },\n                    { name: \"中心点(右上)\", r: midR - 1, c: midC },\n                    { name: \"中心点(左下)\", r: midR, c: midC - 1 },\n                    { name: \"中心点(右下)\", r: midR, c: midC }\n                );\n            } else {\n                points.push({\n                    name: \"中心点\",\n                    r: Math.floor(config.boardRows \/ 2),\n                    c: Math.floor(config.boardCols \/ 2)\n                });\n            }\n\n            points.forEach(p => {\n                const { x, y } = this.getBoardXY(config, p.r, p.c);\n                UI.showToast(`点击: ${p.name}`);\n                Logger.debug(`[测试引擎] 点击 ${p.name} 格子 (${p.r}, ${p.c}) -> 坐标 (${x}, ${y})`);\n                zdjl.click(x, y, 100);\n                zdjl.sleep(800);\n            });\n            UI.showToast(\"4角点+中心点测试完成\");\n        },\n\n        testSequentialDraw(config) {\n            UI.showToast(\"测试：顺序填充作画\");\n            Logger.debug(\"[测试引擎] 开始全矩阵逐行逐列顺序点击测试\");\n            for (let r = 0; r < config.boardRows; r++) {\n                for (let c = 0; c < config.boardCols; c++) {\n                    const { x, y } = this.getBoardXY(config, r, c);\n                    Logger.debug(`[测试引擎] 点击格子 (${r}, ${c}) -> 坐标 (${x}, ${y})`);\n                    zdjl.click(x, y, config.boardClickDuration);\n                    zdjl.sleep(config.delayBoard);\n                }\n            }\n            UI.showToast(\"顺序填充测试完成\");\n        }\n    };\n\n    \/\/ ================= 9. 主流程入口与菜单导航调度 =================\n    try {\n        Logger.debug(\"[主流程] 启动全局初始化与配置读取\");\n        const config = Config.load();\n        if (!config) {\n            Logger.error(\"[主流程] 加载全局配置失败，终止执行\");\n            return;\n        }\n\n        while (true) {\n            const mode = showModeSelection();\n\n            if (mode === -1) {\n                Logger.info(\"[主流程] 用户在主界面点击取消，正常退出脚本\");\n                UI.showToast(\"已退出运行\");\n                return;\n            }\n\n            Logger.debug(`[主流程] 用户选定运行模式: ${mode}`);\n\n            \/\/ 模式 1：正常作画\n            if (mode === 0) {\n                while (true) {\n                    const inputMode = showInputMenu();\n                    if (inputMode === -1) {\n                        Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 用户取消数据输入菜单，返回上一级菜单 (主界面)\");\n                        break; \/\/ 返回主界面菜单\n                    }\n\n                    let inputContent = \"\";\n                    if (inputMode === 0) {\n                        const rawStr = promptDataInput(\"请输入 JSON 或 色号文本\");\n                        if (rawStr && rawStr.trim()) {\n                            inputContent = rawStr.trim();\n                        } else {\n                            Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 用户取消文本输入或输入为空，返回数据输入菜单\");\n                            continue;\n                        }\n                    } else if (inputMode === 1) {\n                        const fileContent = pickLocalFile(\"\/sdcard\/Download\");\n                        if (fileContent && fileContent.trim()) {\n                            inputContent = fileContent.trim();\n                        } else {\n                            Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 文件选择中断，返回数据输入菜单\");\n                            continue;\n                        }\n                    }\n\n                    if (!inputContent) {\n                        Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 未抓取到有效数据，返回数据输入菜单\");\n                        continue;\n                    }\n\n                    Logger.debug(\"[流程] 触发数据校验与结构解析...\");\n                    const checkResult = DataParser.validate(inputContent);\n                    if (!checkResult.valid) {\n                        UI.showToast(\"数据校验错误: \" + checkResult.message);\n                        Logger.error(\"[校验错误]\", checkResult.message);\n                        continue; \/\/ 校验错误，退回数据输入菜单\n                    }\n\n                    let matrices = null;\n                    try {\n                        matrices = DataParser.parse(inputContent, config);\n                    } catch (e) {\n                        UI.showToast(\"解析抛出异常: \" + e.message);\n                        Logger.error(\"[解析异常]\", e.message);\n                        continue; \/\/ 解析异常，退回数据输入菜单\n                    }\n\n                    if (!matrices || !matrices.length) {\n                        UI.showToast(\"数据解析结果为空\");\n                        Logger.error(\"[解析结果为空]\");\n                        continue;\n                    }\n\n                    if (!ensureBoardPage(config)) {\n                        Logger.error(\"[页面状态] 校验未通过，退回数据输入阶段\");\n                        continue;\n                    }\n\n                    const totalTiles = matrices.length;\n                    let startTile = 0;\n                    const { key, hash, completed } = ProgressManager.loadProgress(inputContent);\n\n                    if (totalTiles > 1 && completed.length > 0) {\n                        const choice = UI.select(`历史进度: 已完成 ${completed.length}\/${totalTiles} 块`, [\n                            \"1. 从断点继续\",\n                            \"2. 清除进度并重新开始\"\n                        ]);\n                        if (choice === 0) {\n                            startTile = completed.length;\n                            UI.showToast(`自第 ${startTile + 1} 区块断点启动`);\n                            Logger.debug(`[断点恢复] 从第 ${startTile + 1} 块继续`);\n                        } else {\n                            completed.length = 0;\n                            ProgressManager.saveProgress(key, hash, []);\n                            Logger.debug(\"[断点恢复] 抹除历史进度，重新开始作画\");\n                        }\n                    } else {\n                        ProgressManager.saveProgress(key, hash, []);\n                    }\n\n                    UI.showToast(\"请移开悬浮窗\");\n                    zdjl.sleep(1000);\n                    UI.showToast(`即将在 ${Math.ceil(config.delayStart \/ 1000)} 秒后启动`);\n                    zdjl.sleep(config.delayStart);\n\n                    for (let ti = startTile; ti < totalTiles; ti++) {\n                        const matrix = matrices[ti];\n                        UI.showToast(`正在作画区块 ${ti + 1}\/${totalTiles}`);\n                        Logger.info(`[作画进度] 开始渲染区块 ${ti + 1}\/${totalTiles}`);\n\n                        PainterEngine.renderMatrix(config, matrix);\n\n                        UI.showToast(\"保存当前区块...\");\n                        Logger.debug(\"[作画进度] 点击保存当前区块\");\n                        PainterEngine.safeFindAndClick(config.saveBtnImg, \"保存\", config.boardClickDuration);\n                        zdjl.sleep(config.delaySave);\n\n                        if (!completed.includes(ti)) {\n                            completed.push(ti);\n                            ProgressManager.saveProgress(key, hash, completed);\n                        }\n\n                        if (ti < totalTiles - 1) {\n                            Logger.debug(\"[作画进度] 点击添加进入下一区块\");\n                            PainterEngine.safeFindAndClick(config.addBtnImg, \"添加\", config.boardClickDuration);\n                            zdjl.sleep(config.delayNew);\n                        } else {\n                            UI.showToast(\"全图绘制完成！\");\n                            Logger.info(\"[作画进度] 包含的所有区块渲染完毕\");\n                        }\n                    }\n                    \n                    Logger.info(\"[流程结束] 正常作画任务全部完成，正常退出脚本运行\");\n                    return;\n                }\n            }\n\n            \/\/ 模式 2：循环测试\n            if (mode === 1) {\n                while (true) {\n                    const testChoice = showTestMenu();\n\n                    if (testChoice === -1) {\n                        Logger.debug(\"[菜单导航] 用户取消测试菜单，返回上一级菜单 (主界面)\");\n                        break; \/\/ 返回主界面菜单\n                    }\n\n                    if (!ensureBoardPage(config)) continue;\n\n                    if (testChoice === 0) PainterEngine.testCornersAndCenter(config);\n                    else if (testChoice === 1) PainterEngine.testSequentialDraw(config);\n                    else if (testChoice === 2) {\n                        const loopMatrix = PainterEngine.generateLoopTestMatrix(config);\n                        PainterEngine.renderMatrix(config, loopMatrix);\n                    }\n\n                    Logger.info(\"[流程结束] 测试任务顺利完成，退出脚本运行\");\n                    return;\n                }\n            }\n\n            \/\/ 模式 3：Debug 提取\n            if (mode === 2) {\n                if (ensureBoardPage(config)) {\n                    PaletteController.extractColors(config);\n                }\n                Logger.info(\"[流程结束] Debug 提取完成，退出脚本运行\");\n                return;\n            }\n\n            \/\/ 模式 4：访问配套数据网站\n            if (mode === 3) {\n                Logger.info(\"[流程结束] 打开配套链接，退出脚本运行\");\n                zdjl.runAction({ type: \"打开链接\", delayUnit: 1, link: \"https:\/\/3049298988.github.io\/PixelBead-Crafts\/\" });\n                return;\n            }\n        }\n    } catch (e) {\n        UI.showToast(\"脚本运行时错误: \" + e.message);\n        Logger.error(\"[主流程未捕获异常]\", e);\n    }\n})();\n"}
